      "skos:definition": "(1) A request by a Tribunal, for assistance that it needs to perform its\nfunctions in respect of an investigation or prosecution it is\nconducting or proposes to conduct, is to be made to the\nAttorney-General, or a person authorised by the Attorney-General.",
