      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\n(a) a magistrate was satisfied under subsection (2) that such a\nnotice was likely to be given in relation to the person within a\nparticular period; and\n(b) the notice is not given within the period;\nthe person must be brought before a magistrate.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If:\n(a) a magistrate was satisfied under subsection (2) that such a\nnotice was likely to be given in relation to the person within a\nparticular period; and\n(b) the notice is not given within the period;\nthe person must be brought before a magistrate.",
