      },
      "dc:source": "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n(a) a person is arrested under a warrant issued under section 10;\nand",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If:\n(a) a person is arrested under a warrant issued under section 10;\nand",
      "values:partOf": {
