      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to section 19, if the Attorney-General determines that the\nperson is to be surrendered to the Tribunal, the Attorney-General\nmust issue a warrant for the surrender of the person to the Tribunal.\n(2) The surrender warrant must be in writing in the statutory form.",
