      "dc:source": "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The evidence of a witness may be taken under section 27 in the\npresence or absence of:\n(a) the person to whom the proceeding before, or the\ninvestigation conducted by, the Tribunal relates; or\n(b) his or her legal representative (if any).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The evidence of a witness may be taken under section 27 in the\npresence or absence of:\n(a) the person to whom the proceeding before, or the\ninvestigation conducted by, the Tribunal relates; or\n(b) his or her legal representative (if any).",
