      "cof:title": "29(1) Legal representation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 34,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The evidence of a witness may be taken under section 27 in the\npresence or absence of:\n(a) the person to whom the proceeding before, or the\ninvestigation conducted by, the Tribunal relates; or\n(b) his or her legal representative (if any)."
    },
