      "values:originalText": "(3) In this section:\nauthorised applicant has the same meaning as in\nsubsection 23WA(1) of the Crimes Act 1914.\nsuspect has the same meaning as in subsection 23WA(1) of the\nCrimes Act 1914."
    },
