      "values:originalText": "If:\n(a) a court makes a restraining order under Part 2-1 of the\nProceeds of Crime Act 2002 against property in respect of the\nTribunal offence; and",
      "skos:definition": "If:\n(a) a court makes a restraining order under Part 2-1 of the\nProceeds of Crime Act 2002 against property in respect of the\nTribunal offence; and",
