      "skos:note": "An authorised officer must provide a written direction to the Attorney-General on how to deal with retained documents."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995#sec-40ag",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40AG Retaining produced documents",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 55,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An authorised officer who takes possession of a document under a\nproduction order made in respect of a Tribunal offence may retain\nthe document pending a written direction from the\nAttorney-General as to how to deal with the document."
    },
