      },
      "dc:source": "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Unless the court gives leave, an application under subsection (1) is\nto be made before the end of 6 weeks beginning on the day when\nthe forfeiture order is registered in the court.",
