      },
      "dc:source": "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.81",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n(a) it is not practicable to examine or process the things at the\nwarrant premises; or\n(b) the occupier of the premises consents in writing;",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If:\n(a) it is not practicable to examine or process the things at the\nwarrant premises; or\n(b) the occupier of the premises consents in writing;",
      "values:partOf": {
