      },
      "dc:source": "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.85",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:\n(a) the thing was seized under paragraph 58(2)(b) or (c); or\n(b) possession by the occupier of the document, film, computer\nfile, thing or information could constitute an offence against\nan Australian law.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:\n(a) the thing was seized under paragraph 58(2)(b) or (c); or\n(b) possession by the occupier of the document, film, computer\nfile, thing or information could constitute an offence against\nan Australian law.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-60"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-60-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b244c81740821c2b26ff5963b8d715c1044fc0e3744b1696dc1a87e43b7175ef",
      "skos:note": "Exemption from subsection (1) for certain seizures"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995#sec-60-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60(2) Copies of seized things to be provided",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 85,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:\n(a) the thing was seized under paragraph 58(2)(b) or (c); or\n(b) possession by the occupier of the document, film, computer\nfile, thing or information could constitute an offence against\nan Australian law."
    },
