      "dc:source": "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.87",
      "values:originalText": "When a police officer exercises a power under section 63 in\nrelation to a conveyance, he or she:",
      "skos:definition": "When a police officer exercises a power under section 63 in\nrelation to a conveyance, he or she:",
