      "skos:definition": "(1) If a person who has been arrested under this Act or pursuant to a\nwarrant issued under this Act is brought to a police station, a police\nofficer may:\n(a) if an ordinary search of the person has not been conducted—\nconduct an ordinary search of the person; or\n(b) subject to this section, conduct a strip search of the person.",
