      "values:originalText": "(1) An ordinary search or a frisk search of a person under this Part\nmust, if practicable, be conducted by a person of the same sex as\nthe person being searched.\n(2) An officer assisting who is not a police officer must not take part in\nan ordinary search or a frisk search of a person under this Part."
    },
