      "cml:conclusionText": "Must deliver to Commissioner"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995-sec-77-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "77(2) Retention of things seized",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995#sec-77-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to subsection (5), the Commissioner must:\n(a) inform the Attorney-General that the thing has been so\ndelivered; and\n(b) retain the thing pending the Attorney-General’s direction\nunder subsection (3) about how to deal with the thing; and\n\n\nSearch, seizure and powers of arrest  Part 7\nGeneral  Division 5\nSection 77\nInternational War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995\nCompilation date: 28/03/2026\n(c) comply with any such direction that the Attorney-General\ngives.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subject to subsection (5), the Commissioner must:\n(a) inform the Attorney-General that the thing has been so\ndelivered; and\n(b) retain the thing pending the Attorney-General’s direction\nunder subsection (3) about how to deal with the thing; and\n\n\nSearch, seizure and powers of arrest  Part 7\nGeneral  Division 5\nSection 77\nInternational War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995\nCompilation date: 28/03/2026\n(c) comply with any such direction that the Attorney-General\ngives.",
      "values:partOf": {
