      },
      "dc:source": "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Attorney-General may, by written notice, give the\nCommissioner a direction about how to deal with the thing.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Attorney-General may, by written notice, give the\nCommissioner a direction about how to deal with the thing.",
      "values:partOf": {
