      },
      "dc:source": "international-war-crimes-tribunals-act-1995.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting the directions that may be given, a direction may\nrequire the Commissioner to send the thing to a Tribunal.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Without limiting the directions that may be given, a direction may\nrequire the Commissioner to send the thing to a Tribunal.",
