      "values:originalText": "(3) The assistance may be granted unconditionally or subject to such\nconditions as the Attorney-General determines.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The assistance may be granted unconditionally or subject to such\nconditions as the Attorney-General determines.",
      "values:partOf": {
