      "skos:definition": "(1) The Governor-General may make arrangements with the Governor\nof a State with respect to the administration of this Act, including\narrangements for the performance of the functions of a magistrate\nunder this Act by all or any of the persons who from time to time\nhold office as magistrates of that State.",
